      "text": [
        ": سئل أبو عبد الله: هل ولد القائم ؟ فقال: لا، ولو أدركته لخدمته أيام حياتي."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.abdullah-al-shahin": [
          "(46) Ali bin Ahmad al-Bandaneeji narrated from Obaydillah bin Musa al-Alawi from al-Hasan bin Mo’awiya from al-Hasan bin Mahboob that Khallad bin as-Saffar had said: “Once Abu Abdullah as-Sadiq (as) was asked: Is al-Qa’im born?” He said: “No, he is not. If I live until he is born, I shall serve him as long as I live.”"
        ]
      }
